0018B1  1  96 BB                STX     LAB_IGBY-1,Y    ; save byte in page zero
0018B3  1  88                   DEY                     ; decrement count
0018B4  1  D0 F8                BNE     LAB_2D4E        ; loop if not all done
0018B6  1               
0018B6  1               ; copy block from StrTab to $0000 - $0012
0018B6  1               
0018B6  1               LAB_GMEM:
